Verify: capacity=2^62 < size ≤ 2^63-1: depth→6, capacity > ULLONG_MAX/1024? ULLONG_MAX/1024 = 2^64-1/2^10 ≈ 2^54. Yes, 2^62 > 2^54 → break with depth 6. Correct.

